| `scripts/agent_surface/generate_aad_schema.py` | Fails when the committed AAD JSON Schema differs from the model, and writes it without `--check`. Relative outputs are confined to the project; an explicit absolute output authorizes its parent directory. Escapes exit 2. | `make check-aad` | [`scripts/agent_surface/generate_aad_schema.py --check`](settings.md#command-line-flags) | Skips when pydantic is not installed. | [agent-surface.md](../guides/agent-surface.md) | always |
